+/***********************************************************************
+    created:    2026
+    purpose:    Implements the std::regex based RegexMatcher
+*************************************************************************/
+/***************************************************************************
+ *   Copyright (C) 2004 - 2026 Paul D Turner & The CEGUI Development Team
+ *
+ *   Permission is hereby granted, free of charge, to any person obtaining
